Tokenizer: the tokens of the PHP parser, for PHP source code.

The module tokenizer of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/tokenizer.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/tokenizer.
